# FRIDAY installed into its own checkout (the folder setup runs in is the FRIDAY folder): the installed program,
# the app's root index files and its profiles are not source.
/App/
/inventory.json
/integrity.json
/profiles/

# What FRIDAY writes into this checkout when it is also the FRIDAY folder (the folder setup runs in): the starter kit
# the app installs on its first launch, plus its runtime files. core/__tests__/checkout-runtime-files.test.ts keeps the
# starter-kit list equal to src/lib/friday/capability-seed.ts, so adding a starter pack fails it until this block is updated.
/agents/installed/data-agent/
